# CargoTrace — Phase 4: Custody, Condition Inspections, Damage Incidents & Evidence

## ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, backend architect, logistics-domain specialist, and application-security engineer.

You are continuing development of the existing CargoTrace application in Google AI Studio.

Phase 1 (Foundation), Phase 2 (Authentication and Organizations), and Phase 3 (Shipment Management and CRUD) have been reported complete.

Implement **Phase 4: Custody, Inspections, Damage Incidents, and Evidence Management** directly in the existing codebase.

This is an incremental implementation, not a rebuild. Inspect the actual repository before making changes, reuse existing modules, and preserve all working features.

The goal is to create a reliable, traceable record of cargo custody and physical condition throughout a shipment's journey. This evidence will support investigation in later phases, but Phase 4 must not automatically determine who is legally responsible for damage.

