## 11. EXPLICITLY OUT OF SCOPE

Do not implement the following in Phase 4:

- AI-generated damage attribution.
- Automatic determination of legal or financial liability.
- AI investigation summaries.
- Full investigation case-management workflows.
- Automated claims or insurance processing.
- Billing and invoicing.
- Delivery confirmation as a separate product.
- A new authentication or RBAC architecture.
- Mock shipment records or fabricated evidence.
- Unrelated redesigns or dependency upgrades.

Phase 4 supplies reliable evidence and event records. Phase 5 will build the investigation timeline and identify evidence gaps. Phase 6 will introduce evidence-grounded AI analysis.

